authenticated.

One repo-creds secret, matched by URL prefix https://github.com/variant-inc, so
onboarding the next app needs no credential work. Authenticates as a GitHub App:
the installation token is short-lived and self-renewing, unlike the PAT whose
silent expiry took the QA Flux source down for two days on 2026-08-16.

Access remains bounded by the apps AppProject, which already allows exactly this
prefix and restricts destinations to app-*." 2>/dev/null || step "nothing new to commit"

git --no-pager log --oneline -1
